        "Title": "THE LAST FIVE STANDING",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHSEA",
        "PublicId": "121986931413",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/theark/scene_magpie.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository e0b6cb9a-92eb-4e49-a758-400e5f4a3e14).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\r\rThe Ark Society is preparing for the end of civilization and  prides itself on exclusivity. Apparently, that doesn&#39;t extend to its security department. They can&#39;t seem to distinguish one guard from another.\r\r\rPerhaps they&#39;re clones. Perhaps they&#39;re simply quintuplets willing to work on this ridiculous island.\r\r\rEither way, our client would like to test the Society&#39;s commitment to survival.\r\r\rFive guards, 47. Let&#39;s see how many make it to the apocalypse.\r\r\rGood hunting.",
        "GameVersion": "8.25.0.95",
